        "fields": {
          "notes": "Antonovsky's exact 1911 preface calls the 1907 state the third edition and reports a new reworking of its predecessor. The prior RuNEB record and established Blok scholarship identify one exact Saint Petersburg 1907 third Edition; RNL GAK divider 67133 card 82 independently confirms the Edition sequence and institutionally reports extent VIII, 363 с. The current RNL Primo record 07NLR_LMS004843723, system number 004843723, and RUSMARC 001 v19\\rc\\1717109 now independently expose three physical holdings in the Russian Book Fund under shelfmarks 17.145.5.1, 17.145.5.1а, and 17.145.5.1 Б. Official field and organization-code evidence additionally establishes V 106/216 as an RNL-reported RSL shelfmark, not as a current RSL public record, physically inspected copy, ToS Item, or text witness; predicted RSL route 01003693382 remains HTTP 404 and the БАН row without a call number remains unresolved. These remote coordinates strengthen bibliographic identity only. The literal typography string тип. Ф. Вайсберга и П. Гершунина is not converted into a publisher or provision claim. The GAK card's overwritten handwriting remains untranscribed and is not equated to V 106/216; the RNL digitization form is recommendation-only. The Expression and derivation claim remain provisional, uncollated, and unreviewed. Source-page acquisition remains open, and every institutional request remains an unsent draft."
        },
